# Local documentation instructions

Before documentation work, read these required sources:

- `{{STANDARDS_PATH}}/agent-workflow.md`
- `{{STANDARDS_PATH}}/standard.md`
- `{{STANDARDS_PATH}}/style-guide.md`
- `{{STANDARDS_PATH}}/diagrams.md`

Use the project documentation index for actual commands, terminology, and owners.
Read the maintenance guide in that directory for contract updates and page moves.
Keep work inside the user's authorized scope. The workflow describes delegation
only when authorized. Verify examples and render changed diagrams before reporting
completion. This entry point stays local and ignored under repository policy.
